DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
27652::$$$message_0205_0000_0000$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
27653::$$$message_0205_0000_0001$$$::I hear voices speaking when I pass by Rider's bedroom.::
27654::$$$message_0205_0001_0000$$$::"...what do you think?"[lr]::
27655::$$$message_0205_0001_0001$$$::"But..."[lr]::
27656::$$$message_0205_0001_0002$$$::...I think Rider and Sakura are inside.[lr]::
27657::$$$message_0205_0001_0003$$$::They get along, so it isn't strange at all for them to be in the same room, but there's something different about the enthusiasm in their voices.::
27658::$$$message_0205_0002_0000$$$::"...so I think..."[lr]::
27659::$$$message_0205_0002_0001$$$::"Oh, Rider. If you say that..."[lr]::
27660::$$$message_0205_0002_0002$$$::Usually, Rider is assertive while Sakura is passive.[lr]::
27661::$$$message_0205_0002_0003$$$::But right now, Sakura sounds eager while Rider is half-hearted.::
27662::$$$message_0205_0003_0000$$$::"...Oh. Is that you, Shirou?"[lr]::
27663::$$$message_0205_0003_0001$$$::Figures she would notice me. There's only a paper sliding door between us.[lr]::
27664::$$$message_0205_0003_0002$$$::Her tone seems clipped and cautious, possibly because Sakura is pressuring her.::
27665::$$$message_0205_0004_0000$$$::"Yeah, sorry. I just overheard you while I was walking by. I'll leave."[lr]::
27666::$$$message_0205_0004_0001$$$::"Ah, great timing! Please join us, Senpai!"[lr]::
27667::$$$message_0205_0004_0002$$$::"Sakura!?"[lr]::
27668::$$$message_0205_0004_0003$$$::Sakura invites me in.[lr]::
27669::$$$message_0205_0004_0004$$$::...Rider sounds unusually flustered.::
27670::$$$message_0205_0005_0000$$$::"Hm? Are you sure I can come in?"[lr]::
27671::$$$message_0205_0005_0001$$$::"Sakura, um, I..."[lr]::
27672::$$$message_0205_0005_0002$$$::"I'm sure he'll agree with me. Please? Rider."[lr]::
27673::$$$message_0205_0005_0003$$$::Rider sighs non-committally. I also hear an odd hint of resignation in her voice.[lr]::
27674::$$$message_0205_0005_0004$$$::...I have a feeling I shouldn't intrude, but it would be rude to say no after Sakura invited me.::
27675::$$$message_0205_0006_0000$$$::"...Hm. Should I come back with some tea?"[lr]::
27676::$$$message_0205_0006_0001$$$::"No, but we appreciate the thought."[lr]::
27677::$$$message_0205_0006_0002$$$::"I'll go make us some tea then, Senpai."::
27678::$$$message_0205_0007_0000$$$::The door opens, and Sakura comes out.[lr]::
27679::$$$message_0205_0007_0001$$$::She's beaming, in contrast to Rider's stern frown.::
27680::$$$message_0205_0008_0000$$$::"Is black tea fine?"[lr]::
27681::$$$message_0205_0008_0001$$$::"Yeah, and the snacks are in the usual place. See you soon."::
27682::$$$message_0205_0009_0000$$$::[clfg time=300 rule=シャッター左から storage=桜私服03a(中) textoff=0]Sakura disappears toward the kitchen.[lr]::
27683::$$$message_0205_0009_0001$$$::...I'm wondering if it's okay for me to wait in Rider's room.::
27684::$$$message_0205_0010_0000$$$::"...Can I come in, Rider?"[lr]::
27685::$$$message_0205_0010_0001$$$::She nods.[lr]::
27686::$$$message_0205_0010_0002$$$::Ominous... Okay, not exactly, but it does feel unusual to see her this bothered by her conversation with Sakura.::
27687::$$$message_0205_0011_0000$$$::Once I'm inside, the reason becomes clear.[lr]::
27688::$$$message_0205_0011_0001$$$::Rider and Sakura's floor cushions are surrounded by open fashion catalogs.[lr]::
27689::$$$message_0205_0011_0002$$$::Rider's sitting in the middle, looking like a toad, surrounded by mirrors, who can't sleep at night... I guess that's a terrible simile.::
27690::$$$message_0205_0012_0000$$$::"What's all this?"[lr]::
27691::$$$message_0205_0012_0001$$$::I pick one up and flip through it. The model inside is beautiful, but honestly, Rider, who's right in front of me, has better qualities.[lr]::
27692::$$$message_0205_0012_0002$$$::Though, the point of this catalog is the clothes, not the model.::
27693::$$$message_0205_0013_0000$$$::"I'm not sure what to do, Shirou."[lr]::
27694::$$$message_0205_0013_0001$$$::"...I don't see you feeling that way in front of Sakura very often."[lr]::
27695::$$$message_0205_0013_0002$$$::"Sakura wants to... Um, it's hardly worth mentioning, really."::
27696::$$$message_0205_0014_0000$$$::Rider isn't being very clear, but I gradually start to deduce what's going on.[lr]::
27697::$$$message_0205_0014_0001$$$::Sakura probably brought all these here. I can imagine what happened next.::
27698::$$$message_0205_0015_0000$$$::"Sakura's trying to do a lot, huh?"[lr]::
27699::$$$message_0205_0015_0001$$$::"...Yes."::
27700::$$$message_0205_0016_0000$$$::I know what she's trying to say.[lr]::
27701::$$$message_0205_0016_0001$$$::Sakura probably brought the magazines and catalogs to ask Rider her opinion on various outfits.[lr]::
27702::$$$message_0205_0016_0002$$$::Surely Sakura must've been curious whether she herself would look good in those outfits or not, too.[lr]::
27703::$$$message_0205_0016_0003$$$::But before long, her goal shifted from herself to Rider.::
27704::$$$message_0205_0017_0000$$$::"Yes, I think Rider could dress a little more girly."[lr]::
27705::$$$message_0205_0017_0001$$$::Sakura's back.[lr]::
27706::$$$message_0205_0017_0002$$$::She hands us teacups, while Rider still looks dejected.::
27707::$$$message_0205_0018_0000$$$::"Don't you think so too, Senpai?"[lr]::
27708::$$$message_0205_0018_0001$$$::"...Well, I won't say no."[lr]::
27709::$$$message_0205_0018_0002$$$::Sakura must be concerned about Rider's wardrobe.[lr]::
27710::$$$message_0205_0018_0003$$$::I have to admit, I'm curious.::
27711::$$$message_0205_0019_0000$$$::Rider strikes a neat figure in her usual sweater and jeans, but I do feel that it's a waste of her figure.[lr]::
27712::$$$message_0205_0019_0001$$$::Sakura sometimes gives off a sexiness that makes me not sure what to do with myself, but Rider's vibe is a little different. She's different from the pure Saber or the glamorous Tohsaka, too.::
27713::$$$message_0205_0020_0000$$$::"I told you, Rider. You'd look good in cuter clothes. Like this."::
27714::$$$message_0205_0021_0000$$$::I look at the magazine Sakura is pointing to.[lr]::
27715::$$$message_0205_0021_0001$$$::...This outfit comes with a skirt. Ah, this model looks cute in that combination.::
27716::$$$message_0205_0022_0000$$$::I try to imagine Rider wearing the same outfit.[lr]::
27717::$$$message_0205_0022_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
27718::$$$message_0205_0022_0002$$$::The person I'm imagining is right in front of me, and she's clearly uncomfortable.::
27719::$$$message_0205_0023_0000$$$::I imagine Rider standing here in this outfit, but at the same time, the image of her looking bewildered while having to wear a new outfit comes to mind.::
27720::$$$message_0205_0024_0000$$$::"But she isn't into it at all. What do you think, Senpai?"[lr]::
27721::$$$message_0205_0024_0001$$$::I can believe that, after our earlier conversation.[lr]::
27722::$$$message_0205_0024_0002$$$::If Rider is this unwilling, this will probably be a waste of time.::
27723::$$$message_0205_0025_0000$$$::"...I see."[lr]::
27724::$$$message_0205_0025_0001$$$::I understand that Sakura pulled me in to argue on her side.[lr]::
27725::$$$message_0205_0025_0002$$$::I know that, but...[lr]::
27726::$$$message_0205_0025_0003$$$::"I dunno..."::
27727::$$$message_0205_0026_0000$$$::"But it looked fun when my sister had Saber dress up in different outfits..."[lr]::
27728::$$$message_0205_0026_0001$$$::"Because she's cute, unlike me."::
27729::$$$message_0205_0027_0000$$$::Rider sulks.[lr]::
27730::$$$message_0205_0027_0001$$$::...Sakura and I exchange a look.::
27731::$$$message_0205_0028_0000$$$::"Saber's cute, yeah, but you're pretty, too."[lr]::
27732::$$$message_0205_0028_0001$$$::"I think this is more Saber's style. It wouldn't quite be the right look for you."::
27733::$$$message_0205_0029_0000$$$::The page Sakura is showing us displays one-pieces with lots of frills and ribbons.[lr]::
27734::$$$message_0205_0029_0001$$$::It would look good on Saber, but on Rider...? Nah.::
27735::$$$message_0205_0030_0000$$$::"...True. But what about this?"[lr]::
27736::$$$message_0205_0030_0001$$$::"Oh, you're right. [cacheimage storage=桜私服06b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服06b(中) textoff=0]I like this, it looks so cool..."[lr]::
27737::$$$message_0205_0030_0002$$$::Sakura smiles at a formal black suit that we found just as she flipped to another page.[lr]::
27738::$$$message_0205_0030_0003$$$::A crisp look like this would be a great look with Rider's height and shapely limbs.::
27739::$$$message_0205_0031_0000$$$::"If I wore this, people would just say I look like I'm going to a job interview."[lr]::
27740::$$$message_0205_0031_0001$$$::"But Rider would make you think she's a hotshot executive assistant, yeah."[lr]::
27741::$$$message_0205_0031_0002$$$::Rider looks increasingly bothered.[lr]::
27742::$$$message_0205_0031_0003$$$::After sipping on her tea, she finally speaks up, unable to take it any longer.::
27743::$$$message_0205_0032_0000$$$::"I'm not cute at all, especially considering how tall I am..."::
27744::$$$message_0205_0033_0000$$$::...Rider appears to be extremely self-conscious about her height.[lr]::
27745::$$$message_0205_0033_0001$$$::It's true that she's taller than the average woman, but not so much that it makes her unattractive.::
27746::$$$message_0205_0034_0000$$$::"That's not true, is it, Senpai? Rider is cute, right?"[lr]::
27747::$$$message_0205_0034_0001$$$::"Pretty, too. Anyway, you definitely aren't uncute."[lr]::
27748::$$$message_0205_0034_0002$$$::"I'm a larger woman. Since ancient times, strong, tall women like me have never been considered attractive."::
27749::$$$message_0205_0035_0000$$$::Rider vehemently denies our compliments.[lr]::
27750::$$$message_0205_0035_0001$$$::...But the more stubborn she is about it, the cuter it makes her seem.[lr]::
27751::$$$message_0205_0035_0002$$$::I'm starting to understand how Sakura feels when she tries to recommend clothes to Rider.::
27752::$$$message_0205_0036_0000$$$::"You think so...? I think it would look great on you..."[lr]::
27753::$$$message_0205_0036_0001$$$::"I just need my clothes to fit well, Sakura. You don't need to be so concerned on my account."::
27754::$$$message_0205_0037_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服02e(中) textoff=0]Rider tries to end the conversation.[lr]::
27755::$$$message_0205_0037_0001$$$::But Sakura and I are acting a little like bullies right now.::
27756::$$$message_0205_0038_0000$$$::[line len=3][wait canskip=false time=500][monocro target=all time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服03d(中) textoff=0][wait canskip=false time=500]We make eye contact.[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服06a(中) textoff=0]::
27757::$$$message_0205_0039_0000$$$::"Hey, Senpai? Why don't we go pick out clothes for Rider together next time?"[lr]::
27758::$$$message_0205_0039_0001$$$::"I'd be happy to."[lr]::
27759::$$$message_0205_0039_0002$$$::"Wha..."[lr]::
27760::$$$message_0205_0039_0003$$$::Rider stares at our agreement in shock.[lr]::
27761::$$$message_0205_0039_0004$$$::We keep talking over her speechlessness.::
27762::$$$message_0205_0040_0000$$$::"Where should we go? I'm not too familiar with clothes stores."[lr]::
27763::$$$message_0205_0040_0001$$$::"There's a lot of them at Verde, over in Shinto. We can browse there. The fall and winter collections are in stock now, so I'd like to pick some out for myself, too."[lr]::
27764::$$$message_0205_0040_0002$$$::"No, uh, um, I..."::
27765::$$$message_0205_0041_0000$$$::"Rider will take center stage, obviously. I'm sure we'll find something cute and Senpai-approved for you.[lr]::
27766::$$$message_0205_0041_0001$$$::So you need to come too, [cacheimage storage=桜私服03b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服03b(中) textoff=0]okay?"::
27767::$$$message_0205_0042_0000$$$::Rider winces at the "okay," like an athlete losing ground at a competition.[lr]::
27768::$$$message_0205_0042_0001$$$::She looks to me pleadingly for help.::
27769::$$$message_0205_0043_0000$$$::"Why not? The three of us should go shopping sometime."[lr]::
27770::$$$message_0205_0043_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
27771::$$$message_0205_0043_0002$$$::Checkmate.[lr]::
27772::$$$message_0205_0043_0003$$$::She'd probably say no if she was going with me alone, but she can't since Sakura's involved.::
27773::$$$message_0205_0044_0000$$$::"...I suppose you two leave me no choice. I'll accompany you, even though I'm inexperienced."[lr]::
27774::$$$message_0205_0044_0001$$$::"Yay! Senpai, let's go together next time!"::
27775::$$$message_0205_0045_0000$$$::Sakura jumps for joy, while Rider is resigned to her fate.[lr]::
27776::$$$message_0205_0045_0001$$$::Anyway, we've made plans to go out together.::
27777::$$$message_0205_0046_0000$$$::...Sorry, Rider.[lr]::
27778::$$$message_0205_0046_0001$$$::Still, it doesn't feel like we're forcing her to do something she absolutely doesn't want to do, so I hope she thinks of it as something that'll make Sakura happy.::
27779::$$$message_0205_0047_0000$$$::"Wow, I have a big responsibility now...[cacheimage storage=桜私服07c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07c(中) textoff=0] I'm going to have to decide what looks cute on Rider."[lr]::
27780::$$$message_0205_0047_0001$$$::"You'll be fine. Rider looks good in everything. Even I'm jealous of her figure."::
27781::$$$message_0205_0048_0000$$$::"...You say that, but you're far lovelier than I am, I guarantee it.[lr]::
27782::$$$message_0205_0048_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=ライダー私服01b(中) pos=l time=300 textoff=0]I'm sure Shirou thinks so, too."[lr]::
27783::$$$message_0205_0048_0002$$$::"Uh..."::
27784::$$$message_0205_0049_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10d(中) textoff=0]Sakura looks bewildered by Rider's compliment.[lr]::
27785::$$$message_0205_0049_0001$$$::  I think it's against the rules to turn the tables on us like this. Sakura seems upset at me, now.::
27786::$$$message_0205_0050_0000$$$::"Th-that isn't true, is it, Senpai!?"[lr]::
27787::$$$message_0205_0050_0001$$$::"I-I can't deny it... I mean Sakura, you're, um..."[lr]::
27788::$$$message_0205_0050_0002$$$::"Hehehe..."[lr]::
27789::$$$message_0205_0050_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10d頬(中) textoff=0]She got us right at the end, but at least it also seems like Rider's mood has finally improved.[lr]::
27790::$$$message_0205_0050_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10e頬(中) textoff=0]Picking clothes for Rider, huh...[lr]::
27791::$$$message_0205_0050_0005$$$::I don't think I'm the right person for the job, but I am interested in the outcome.::
27792::$$$message_0205_0051_0000$$$::"We'd better drink the tea before it gets cold."[lr]::
27793::$$$message_0205_0051_0001$$$::"O-oh, you two..."::
927763::$$$message_9205_0040_0001$$$::"There's a lot of them at Verde, over in Shinto. We can browse there. "::
H